1
00:00:48,810 --> 00:00:53,020
[The Old Story of Yu Hong]

2
00:00:53,390 --> 00:00:55,690
[Episode 16]

3
00:01:45,210 --> 00:01:46,009
Mrs. Zhou,

4
00:01:46,009 --> 00:01:47,479
aren't these clothes your family's?

5
00:01:47,870 --> 00:01:49,009
How are they so messed up?

6
00:01:49,009 --> 00:01:50,009
You're really careless.

7
00:02:13,180 --> 00:02:16,430
[Photo Studio]

8
00:04:08,100 --> 00:04:08,780
Take a seat here.

9
00:04:26,180 --> 00:04:26,750
We'd like to order.

10
00:04:30,540 --> 00:04:32,180
Shrimp with green peas.

11
00:04:35,430 --> 00:04:36,480
Stir-fried eel shreds.

12
00:04:38,220 --> 00:04:39,010
Sliced pork with egg white.

13
00:04:42,370 --> 00:04:43,690
Maybe order less.

14
00:04:43,690 --> 00:04:45,210
It's just the two of us.
So pricey to eat here.

15
00:04:45,540 --> 00:04:46,100
Don't worry.

16
00:04:48,510 --> 00:04:49,390
Double sesame flaky pastry.

17
00:04:49,750 --> 00:04:51,510
Plus a white fungus
and fruit dessert soup.

18
00:04:52,100 --> 00:04:52,740
Serve them now.

19
00:04:53,690 --> 00:04:54,360
Okay.

20
00:04:54,360 --> 00:04:54,950
Thank you.

21
00:04:59,180 --> 00:04:59,740
I haven't played

22
00:04:59,740 --> 00:05:01,540
the host properly during your stay here.

23
00:05:01,540 --> 00:05:02,890
You keep treating me to meals.

24
00:05:06,740 --> 00:05:07,930
How are you the host now?

25
00:05:08,300 --> 00:05:09,770
We're both from Tiecheng.

26
00:05:30,130 --> 00:05:30,770
Fang.

27
00:05:37,540 --> 00:05:38,860
I'm going back tomorrow.

28
00:05:42,420 --> 00:05:43,220
So I figured I should

29
00:05:43,570 --> 00:05:45,659
treat you to a proper dinner
before departure.

30
00:05:52,720 --> 00:05:54,250
I rarely go on business trips.

31
00:05:57,720 --> 00:05:58,690
Who knows

32
00:06:04,750 --> 00:06:06,800
when we will see each other next time.

33
00:06:09,890 --> 00:06:11,040
But rest assured.

34
00:06:11,040 --> 00:06:12,660
I'll definitely come visit you
when I have time.

35
00:06:39,040 --> 00:06:40,310
I'd like to go to a specialty store to buy

36
00:06:40,310 --> 00:06:41,630
some local treats
for my co-workers tomorrow.

37
00:06:41,870 --> 00:06:42,810
Shall we go together?

38
00:06:48,480 --> 00:06:49,620
I'm tied up tomorrow.

39
00:06:55,810 --> 00:06:56,540
Well then...

40
00:07:00,630 --> 00:07:02,190
My train leaves at 8:30 tomorrow.

41
00:07:05,310 --> 00:07:06,330
Will you come see me off?

42
00:07:19,430 --> 00:07:20,810
I wish you a safe journey.

43
00:07:34,480 --> 00:07:35,680
Let go!

44
00:07:40,010 --> 00:07:40,980
Let go!

45
00:07:42,560 --> 00:07:43,510
Let go.

46
00:07:45,300 --> 00:07:45,810
Let go!

47
00:07:45,810 --> 00:07:46,750
What's going on?

48
00:07:47,130 --> 00:07:48,040
Why are you fighting again?

49
00:07:48,040 --> 00:07:49,159
Let go, both of you.

50
00:07:49,560 --> 00:07:50,270
Let go!

51
00:07:51,450 --> 00:07:53,130
Can the two of you just stop fighting?

52
00:07:53,130 --> 00:07:54,770
As the older sister, can't you go easy
on your little brother?

53
00:07:54,770 --> 00:07:57,040
And you. Why do you have to fight
your sister over everything?

54
00:07:57,510 --> 00:07:58,890
What have you learned at school?

55
00:07:58,890 --> 00:08:00,500
Respect the old
and care for the young, okay? Come on.

56
00:08:02,860 --> 00:08:04,220
I didn't get it again.

57
00:08:04,770 --> 00:08:05,420
Go in the room.

58
00:08:06,010 --> 00:08:07,370
No more fighting.

59
00:08:07,370 --> 00:08:08,010
Go inside.

60
00:08:08,660 --> 00:08:09,330
Hao Fang,

61
00:08:09,800 --> 00:08:11,160
bring the clothes in.

62
00:08:11,160 --> 00:08:12,660
It's going to rain.

63
00:09:50,510 --> 00:09:51,670
Mrs. Zhou,

64
00:09:52,290 --> 00:09:54,340
when did you start smoking?

65
00:09:54,630 --> 00:09:56,650
Aren't you afraid your husband will mind?

66
00:10:01,740 --> 00:10:02,360
I get mad...

67
00:10:03,220 --> 00:10:05,590
just at the sight of your wife.

68
00:10:06,000 --> 00:10:07,870
She's really infuriating.

69
00:10:08,580 --> 00:10:09,370
What happened?

70
00:10:09,650 --> 00:10:10,410
"What happened?"

71
00:10:10,890 --> 00:10:12,720
I told her not to wash her hair so often,

72
00:10:12,840 --> 00:10:13,820
but she just did it again.

73
00:10:14,360 --> 00:10:15,320
Is her hair so dirty

74
00:10:15,320 --> 00:10:16,200
that she has to wash it every day?

75
00:10:16,480 --> 00:10:18,630
The water for washing hair costs money,
doesn't it?

76
00:10:18,630 --> 00:10:19,840
I get it now.

77
00:10:19,840 --> 00:10:21,060
You get it?

78
00:10:21,250 --> 00:10:23,530
Only you would fancy her. You see,

79
00:10:23,630 --> 00:10:25,930
someone introduced a girl to you
a long time ago.

80
00:10:26,320 --> 00:10:29,170
She was pretty
and had a lot going for her.

81
00:10:29,190 --> 00:10:31,610
Yet you didn't like her.

82
00:10:32,100 --> 00:10:33,100
Keep it down.

83
00:10:33,100 --> 00:10:34,290
Others could hear you.

84
00:10:34,620 --> 00:10:35,510
"Keep it down?"

85
00:10:35,510 --> 00:10:37,460
Even all the neighbors know.

86
00:10:37,750 --> 00:10:39,170
I've been saying it for years.

87
00:10:39,170 --> 00:10:40,200
Can your wife speak Shanghainese?

88
00:10:40,200 --> 00:10:41,170
No.

89
00:10:41,170 --> 00:10:42,200
She doesn't even understand it till now.

90
00:10:43,860 --> 00:10:45,050
Enough said. Stop it.

91
00:10:45,340 --> 00:10:46,150
"Enough said."

92
00:10:46,150 --> 00:10:47,790
All you do is paper over things with me.

93
00:10:48,650 --> 00:10:50,220
All my years of raising you meant nothing.

94
00:11:57,730 --> 00:12:05,870
♪ Your image from yesterday
is still before my eyes ♪

95
00:12:07,480 --> 00:12:15,620
♪ The laughter from yesterday
still rings in my ears ♪

96
00:12:17,320 --> 00:12:25,960
♪ Years drift away in silence ♪

97
00:12:27,150 --> 00:12:36,480
♪ The warmth in my heart never fades ♪

98
00:12:39,320 --> 00:12:47,730
♪ I'll follow you to the edge of the sky ♪

99
00:12:49,160 --> 00:12:57,860
♪ Hand in hand until the end of time ♪

100
00:12:59,150 --> 00:13:07,930
♪ Along the path
that the years have left behind ♪

101
00:13:08,840 --> 00:13:18,500
♪ We shall meet again
in the mist-like yesterday ♪

102
00:13:21,280 --> 00:13:29,540
♪ I'll follow you to the edge of the sky ♪

103
00:13:30,890 --> 00:13:39,470
♪ Hand in hand until the end of time ♪

104
00:13:40,830 --> 00:13:49,810
♪ Along the path
that the years have left behind ♪

105
00:13:50,440 --> 00:14:00,670
♪ We shall meet again
in the mist-like yesterday ♪

106
00:14:07,630 --> 00:14:16,080
♪ Faces change and years pass ♪

107
00:14:17,250 --> 00:14:26,490
♪ The warmth in my heart never fades ♪

108
00:14:27,220 --> 00:14:36,010
♪ I'll follow you to the edge of the sky ♪

109
00:14:28,370 --> 00:14:28,860
Fang,

110
00:14:30,050 --> 00:14:30,890
go with me.

111
00:14:33,170 --> 00:14:34,370
I know I'm silly.

112
00:14:36,390 --> 00:14:38,550
You told me the ancient story
of Wei Sheng holding the pillar.

113
00:14:36,940 --> 00:14:49,450
♪ We shall meet again
in the mist-like yesterday ♪

114
00:14:39,890 --> 00:14:41,320
I think I'm just like Weisheng.

115
00:14:42,890 --> 00:14:44,200
I don't want to be apart from you.

116
00:14:45,150 --> 00:14:46,620
When I'm back home, I'll get a divorce

117
00:14:47,840 --> 00:14:48,790
and tell my wife everything.

118
00:14:56,570 --> 00:15:05,010
♪ I'll follow you to the edge of the sky ♪

119
00:14:58,460 --> 00:15:00,290
I got paid less
than the previous month again.

120
00:15:00,630 --> 00:15:01,860
People pick on me every day.

121
00:15:02,630 --> 00:15:03,740
This is so annoying.

122
00:15:06,100 --> 00:15:07,620
What an expensive spread today.

123
00:15:06,390 --> 00:15:14,730
♪ We shall meet again
in the mist-like yesterday ♪

124
00:15:08,550 --> 00:15:09,630
Three dishes and a soup.

125
00:15:10,720 --> 00:15:12,500
You knew I received my salary
today, right?

126
00:15:16,360 --> 00:15:17,620
Here, put it away.

127
00:15:21,340 --> 00:15:22,550
I have something to tell you.

128
00:15:21,690 --> 00:15:30,180
♪ Along the path
that the years have left behind ♪

129
00:15:24,050 --> 00:15:25,130
What do you mean by that?

130
00:15:25,550 --> 00:15:26,780
Are you out of your mind?

131
00:15:27,510 --> 00:15:28,410
You want a divorce?

132
00:15:29,960 --> 00:15:30,530
Let's go for it then.

133
00:15:30,830 --> 00:15:41,950
♪ We shall meet again
in the mist-like yesterday ♪

134
00:15:31,080 --> 00:15:32,040
You think I'd fear you?

135
00:15:32,350 --> 00:15:34,240
Don't ever come back
if you have the guts!

136
00:15:35,220 --> 00:15:37,500
If you are leaving,
take both kids with you!

137
00:15:52,960 --> 00:15:53,530
Director,

138
00:15:53,960 --> 00:15:55,250
you are Weiguo's supervisor.

139
00:15:55,340 --> 00:15:56,580
Please be the judge.

140
00:15:56,250 --> 00:15:58,070
[Production Pioneer
and Quality Model Worker]

141
00:15:57,120 --> 00:15:58,980
My husband Weiguo took a trip to Shanghai

142
00:15:59,080 --> 00:15:59,980
and came back a big shot.

143
00:15:59,980 --> 00:16:01,370
He asked for a divorce
the moment he reached home,

144
00:16:01,370 --> 00:16:02,370
saying that he doesn't love me at all

145
00:16:02,370 --> 00:16:03,500
and that his heart
belongs to someone else.

146
00:16:03,500 --> 00:16:04,870
Director, I just want to ask you

147
00:16:03,560 --> 00:16:06,730
[Production Pioneer
and Quality Model Worker]

148
00:16:05,050 --> 00:16:06,830
if all the men who have been to Shanghai
behave like that.

149
00:16:07,050 --> 00:16:07,720
What's it about now?

150
00:16:07,720 --> 00:16:09,460
Are the women there prettier
and more stylish

151
00:16:09,460 --> 00:16:10,300
than those in Tiecheng?

152
00:16:10,530 --> 00:16:11,320
Comrade Guo,

153
00:16:11,510 --> 00:16:12,460
please calm down.

154
00:16:12,460 --> 00:16:13,430
Sit down and let's talk.

155
00:16:25,870 --> 00:16:26,460
Director,

156
00:16:27,080 --> 00:16:27,720
I know

157
00:16:28,000 --> 00:16:29,770
he made a mistake and that he is guilty.

158
00:16:29,770 --> 00:16:30,580
He has failed the organization

159
00:16:30,580 --> 00:16:31,960
after all these years of nurturing.

160
00:16:32,530 --> 00:16:35,270
But he is just confused.
He is by no means a bad person.

161
00:16:35,360 --> 00:16:36,910
He simply lost his head.

162
00:16:36,910 --> 00:16:38,120
That woman seduced him.

163
00:16:38,440 --> 00:16:40,250
She knew he had a family,

164
00:16:40,250 --> 00:16:41,960
yet she still threw herself at him.

165
00:16:41,960 --> 00:16:43,630
Isn't it a matter of ideological conduct,

166
00:16:43,630 --> 00:16:45,120
and a case of corrupting
the working class?

167
00:16:46,580 --> 00:16:48,120
Today, I came to your office

168
00:16:48,120 --> 00:16:49,510
not because I wanted to destroy him.

169
00:16:50,130 --> 00:16:51,870
I meant to beg the organization
to save him

170
00:16:52,370 --> 00:16:53,770
and our little family.

171
00:16:54,290 --> 00:16:55,460
Our kids are too young.

172
00:16:56,370 --> 00:16:58,750
I can't let them grow up feeling ashamed.

173
00:17:05,329 --> 00:17:06,380
The exit is over there.

174
00:17:06,380 --> 00:17:07,200
Walk straight ahead.

175
00:17:09,500 --> 00:17:10,530
It's too high, isn't it?

176
00:17:10,530 --> 00:17:12,069
Keep moving inside. Mind your safety.

177
00:17:14,109 --> 00:17:14,829
Do you feel cold?

178
00:17:15,460 --> 00:17:15,940
Come on.

179
00:17:15,940 --> 00:17:17,220
Have your mouth covered.

180
00:17:22,530 --> 00:17:24,010
Don't run around. Come here, Hao Peng.

181
00:17:24,089 --> 00:17:25,010
Watch your step.

182
00:17:27,000 --> 00:17:28,310
Keep moving inside. Mind your safety.
